SF0121 Rodeo license plate.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Boner, Brennan, Cooper, Hicks, Kolb and
Pappas and Representative(s) Geringer and Wylie
AN ACT relating to motor vehicle license plates; authorizing specially designed
license plates to recognize rodeo as the official sport of Wyoming; specifying
requirements; authorizing fees; providing for termination of issuance of the
special plates; requiring a report upon termination; authorizing rulemaking;
making a conforming amendment; specifying availability; and providing for an
effective date.
